    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JAL International Timetable\nJan. 1 ~ Mar. 31, 1994\n1-2-3 Ph\nJAL\nThis timetable is printed on recycled\npaper.",
      "1#23371=\nOCS, since its founding supported\nby major Japanese newspapers\n36 years ago, has been devoted to\nthe service of delivering vast vol-\numes of newspapers, magazines,\nbusiness documents and parcels\nto and for businessmen all over\nthe world.\nOCS's worldwide\nservice network will always be\nmaintained as vigorous arteries\npromoting international business.\nTEL. (03) 5476-8106\n251(052) 203-5411: BE (06) 473-2631\nFAX. (03) 3453-8329\nPrinted in Japan.\n2016.113.12"
    ],
